: null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 305.6171875, 157.25, 317.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 332.4765625, 541.5, 360.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 376.4765625, 541.5, 404.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第六节 验证码与时间\n\n出现验证码无效时，先检查验证码是否已过期、是否误输入空格以及设备时间是否明显偏差，再使用本人当前有效的验证码重试。不要连续转发截图寻求他人代填，也不要把验证码写进工单附件。\n\n动态验证码与企业账号密码是不同信息。本文未规定验证码的具体有效秒数、补发次数和锁定阈值；如果提示账号锁定或验证方式不可用，应联系IT服务台，不能按猜测次数持续尝", "rrf_score": 0.031746, "bm25_score": 8.02432, "vector_score": 0.555432}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c018", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r018", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十八节 故障处理问答"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 323.1171875, 168.75, 334.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 349.9765625, 541.5, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 5, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 439.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十八节 故障处理问答\n\n问：验证码错误时先做什么？答：检查当前验证码有效性、输入内容及设备时间，仍失败联系服务台。问：可以把验证码和密码一起发给服务台吗？答：不要提供这些凭据，可以提供错误提示和发生时间。\n\n问：换了网络后仍失败怎么办？答：记录网络、时间、错误提示和已排查步骤，联系服务台。问：连接失败能否关闭安全软件试试？答：本文没有授权此类操作，不应自行", "rrf_score": 0.030769, "bm25_score": 6.198769, "vector_score": 0.524191}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十四条冲突资料的核对清单"], "token_count": 225, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 322.1159423828125, 203.04544677734376, 334.4234130859375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989650157781748}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 348.85283203125, 546.953662109375, 379.4093017578125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990319925911573}, {